export anchor HolographicStyle:
    number: 259
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Holographic
    idea: Floating capsules and glass cards on deep black, each rimmed with a thin iridescent foil edge that shifts from cyan to lilac to pink, so the interface reads as light caught in a hologram while the content stays plain.
    base: dark
    palette:
        void: #06060a, the page and canvas with two faint lilac and cyan glows
        glass: #0e0e16, capsules, cards and the style sheet
        glassRaised: #151522, fields, layer icon tiles and Present
        selectedGlass: #1a1a2a, the selected layer inside its foil rim
        line: #262636, field borders and dividers
        ink: #f2f2fa, text
        mist: #a9a9c2, meta, labels and status
        foilCyan: #7ef3ff, foil start, handles, status icons and focus
        foilLilac: #b9a4ff, foil middle, field keys and the frame outline
        foilPink: #ff9ad5, foil warm stop
        foilGold: #ffe39a, foil highlight stop
        foilMint: #8affc1, foil end
        magenta: #b0189a, the 32 px guide with white text
    type:
        system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial for text and ui-
        monospace for values. Card titles are 20px 650 filled with the foil
        gradient, layer names 14px 550, values 13px 500 mono, meta 12px, and
        group labels 11px caps tracked 0.16em.
    layout:
        Nothing touches the edges. Three capsules float across the top, a file
        capsule with a foil orb B mark, Canvas · Website redesign over Home
        v3, a centred tool capsule with six round tools where Move is filled
        with foil and dark icon then 66%, and a people capsule with three
        pastel avatars, a foil rimmed Present and a foil filled Share. Below
        float a 264px layers card, the frame and a 284px inspector card, each
        glass with a 1px foil rim and 22px corners. Layers show an icon tile,
        name and sub line, Hero inside a foil rim with a foil tile and a cyan
        Selected. The white Hero frame has a lilac outline and round cyan
        ringed handles. The inspector uses chips with mono keys such as X 0, W
        1440, Gap 32, Pad 96, Fmt PNG and Scale 2x. The status is a foil
        capsule centred at the bottom of the canvas. The foil gradient runs at
        115 degrees through #7ef3ff, #b9a4ff, #ff9ad5, #ffe39a and #8affc1.
        Below 860px the pieces stack with the frame and status first and the
        tool capsule sticks to the bottom.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px between floating pieces, 20px card padding, 8px between chips.
    density: Light to medium, everything floating with black between.
    corners: Very round. 22px cards, 14px rows, 12px chips, full capsules for bars and buttons.
    borders: A 1px iridescent foil rim on every capsule, card, the selected row and the comment, with plain 1px lines inside.
    shadows: Soft black 0 20px 50px under cards and a faint cyan bloom under the frame.
    icons:
        Round line icons at 1.5px stroke, 18px, in 30px tiles in the layer
        list. Selected is a circled check, Collapsed a right chevron, Saved a
        cloud with a check, always with the word.
    focus: A 2px cyan outline offset 3px with a 6px cyan haze.
    tone: Light and modern with short labels such as Pad, Fmt and Saved 2 minutes ago.
